  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Prstamo CT Desarrollo y Preparacin Ecotur</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TC Loan Development  Preparation Ecotur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIVIDED IN TWO PHASES, THE FIRST ONE CONTEMPLATES: THE PLANNING OF TOURISM, SPECIALLY ECOTOURISM IN 9 ALREADY CHOSEN SITES BY THE 9 AMAZON STATES, THE MANAGEMENT OF PROTECTED AREAS IN EACH SITE, INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING OF BOTH PUBLIC AND PRIVATE ENTITITIES DIRECTLY INVOLVED WITH TOURISM AND ECOTOURISM, THE DEFINITION AND ESTABLISHMENT OF A LEGAL AND REGULATORY FRAMEWORK, AND THE PREPARATION OF STUDIES AND INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECTS TO BE FINANCED IN A SECOND STAGE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
